OL,3,ANHS data contract to stay with Palantir
OL,4,Auntil 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says it will continue a
OL,7,Fkey NHS data contract in England with
OL,8,Fthe controversial US tech giant
OL,9,FPalantir until 2029, rather than
OL,10,Ftriggering an early release clause next
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FBut ministers are inviting British
OL,14,Ffirms to bid for the contract from
OL,15,F2029, with a procurement programme
OL,16,Fbeginning next summer.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
