OL,3,AChannel 4 admits it doesn't know number
OL,4,Aof Married At First Sight UK sex abuse
OL,5,Acomplaints
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarried at First Sight UK was cancelled
OL,8,Fafter Panorama revealed rape
OL,9,Fallegations from two female cast
OL,10,Fmembers, while a third woman alleged a
OL,11,Fnon-consensual sex act. The men
OL,12,Finvolved have denied all the
OL,13,Fallegations.
OL,15,FSeparately, Dogra said the broadcaster
OL,16,F"cannot apologise enough" to a former
OL,17,Femployee who twice made complaints
OL,18,Fabout Russell Brand and felt they
OL,19,Fweren't properly handled.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
